Holy Gold is a mythical [[Phenomena/Sky Metal|starmetal]] found everywhere in the [[Geography/index|Astra]] in exceptionally small quantities. It's said that it appears only by divine providence, and all attempts to manufacture the metal have failed with grievous consequences.

Legendary armaments such as the Godslayer Needles, Excalibur, and Aut's Armamentarium are said to have been produced from enchanted Holy Gold, but rare is the chance that an artifact of that caliber falls in the hands of someone willing to destroy it for proper metallurgic analysis.

The spikes the Party carries for [[Phenomena/The End|The End]] are Holy Gold: gold spikes about the length of a finger, in which no magic can be found. A single one fired from The End brought down the [[Divinity/The Narrative/Menhir|Menhir]]. [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] knows a spike of the metal as the only way to kill a [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]], and says growths of it appear perhaps once in three or four worlds.
